      "message": "Hi Ray,\nIf we update only \u0027*fuzzed_code_usage*\u0027 field in cc_fuzz of \u0027C2FuzzerXaacDec\u0027, we observed [this build error](https://android-build.corp.google.com/build_explorer/artifact_viewer/P87473561/aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone-trunk_staging-userdebug/logs/build_error.log?attemptId\u003dlatest) due to redefinition of \u0027*fuzzed_code_usage*\u0027 since it was already defined in \u0027c2fuzzer-defaults\u0027.\nTo resolve this issue, we can either remove \u0027*fuzzed_code_usage*\u0027 from defaults and rewrite it for individual targets or remove  \u0027c2fuzzer-defaults\u0027 for \u0027C2FuzzerXaacDec\u0027 and define \u0027*fuzzed_code_usage*\u0027 for it as done in latest patch. Please let us know which approach is preferred.",
